    {
      "id": "p0222-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In the English version of Undertale, the game's programming searches for 69 keywords in the player's essay. In the Japanese version, there are 81 keywords. There are several reasons for this mismatch:",
        "raw": "In the English version of Undertale, the game's programming searches for 69\nkeywords in the player's essay. In the Japanese version, there are 81 keywords.\nThere are several reasons for this mismatch:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29700669,
          0.22888571,
          0.89692113,
          0.27858571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29497184,
          0.22817143,
          0.90551837,
          0.27965714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          6,
          7,
          8
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "英文版《Undertale》的程序会在玩家作文中搜索 69 个关键词；日文版则有 81 个。数量不同有几个原因：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 13,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
