      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The Japanese version of Undertale also includes a new set of 14 keywords that result in all-new Mettaton EX responses. For example, if a Japanese player includes the word nihongo (\"Japanese language\") in the essay, Mettaton EX will respond with:",
