    {
      "id": "p0222-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "When Toby originally designed this essay scene, he put a lot of thought into how it should work and how Mettaton EX should react as ifhe were an actual, living character. As we can see, the localization team put just as much care into how the Japanese scene should work technically and linguistically.",
        "raw": "When Toby originally designed this essay scene, he put a lot of thought into\nhow it should work and how Mettaton EX should react as ifhe were an actual,\nliving character. As we can see, the localization team put just as much care into\nhow the Japanese scene should work technically and linguistically.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29804446,
          0.59498571,
          0.90348352,
          0.66114286
